  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heal, Empower, Rise &#x2013; Counter Trafficking in Persons (HER CTIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In an effort to address gaps on care for Victims of Trafficking (VoTs) and build upon previous and current initiatives within the national domain, the proposed project aims to strengthen the victim support environment in Trinidad and Tobago, so that VoTs have access to timely and quality support and services that facilitates healing and empowerment and propel them to living meaningful and productive lives. It will also support Trinidad and Tobago&#x2019;s national (Government and NGOs) response to VoTs through augmentation, enhancement as well as enrichment of protection and assistance services and systems to potential, presumed, and confirmed VoTs.</narrative>
  </description>
